BT 1 0 0 1 0 62 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL (The Script-Controlled ACL District Record Access in ServiceNow project is designed to provide a) Tj T* (secure, role-based mechanism for controlling access to district records. In organizations that) Tj T* (manage information across multiple districts, unauthorized access can lead to security breaches,) Tj T* -0.133128 Tw (data leakage, and compliance issues. The proposed solution leverages ServiceNow Access Control) Tj T* 0 Tw (Lists \(ACLs\) and scripting mechanisms to ensure that only authorized users can access records) Tj T* (belonging to their assigned district.) Tj T* ET
Q
