q
0 0 0 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 26 Tm /F1 10 Tf 12 TL (The system performs user authentication, role verification, district validation, and ACL execution) Tj T* (before granting access. This approach improves security, reduces manual administration, and) Tj T* (supports organizational governance requirements.) Tj T* ET
